<title>USA: Advanced Mammography lawsuit dismissed.</title>
<headline>Advanced Mammography lawsuit dismissed.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Mass. 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced Mammography Systems Inc said on Tuesday that the Chancery Court of Delaware dismissed the consolidated class action against the company and Advanced NMR Systems Inc.</p>
<p>The lawsuit was filed against the companies and their executives regarding a proposed merger that was subsequently abandoned in May 1996, Advanced Mammography said.</p>
<p>All claims against the companies and their respective officers and directors were dismissed as moot, the company said. Advanced Mammography Systems Inc said it will pay plaintiffs' counsel fees to the extent of $50,000.</p>
</text>
